{"version":1,"key":"card:684","content":{"id":684,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"癌症怎么导致人死亡的，每个人都有差异，死亡原因各不相同，但大致上和器官衰竭有关。","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"脑癌，肿瘤压迫重要神经导致死亡","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"肺癌，生长填充肺部空间，导致氧气交换能力下降，最后因肺衰竭死亡","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"血癌，白血病细胞抢夺正常红细胞和免疫细胞生存空间，导致系统性缺氧，出现免疫缺陷导致死亡","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"list-item"}],"type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["医学/癌症"],"createTime":1771048296116,"updateTime":1771725414072,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1771725414072}}